<http://purl.org/nanopub/temp/np1/assertion> {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-blueprint-cattle-queries> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/EvidenceItem> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-blueprint-cattle-queries> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Ontology queries and term identifiers behind the \"cattle\" blueprint" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-blueprint-cattle-queries> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "10 SPARQL queries against Ubergraph (Uberon, Cell Ontology, Protein Ontology and NCBI Taxonomy with materialised subClassOf and part_of closures), each stored in organism-design/examples/cattle.json with its purpose, the query text, the endpoint, the retrieval time and the row count. Every response is cached under organism-design/cache/ keyed by the SHA-256 of the query text, so the blueprint rebuilds offline from the same bytes. Latest retrieval 2026-10-31T06:47:04.325Z. The 81 body, organ-system and organ identifiers of this blueprint are referenced below; the 280 tissue and 369 cell-type identifiers are listed in the cited file." .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-blueprint-cattle-queries> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "organism-design/examples/cattle.json" .
